{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的音乐细节和情绪变化颗粒度不如 X，缺少随乐段出现的细微提示，重点句也少了醒目的视觉强调。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分工稳定，左边用自然完整的叙述交代心理变化和前因后果，右边短词补充身体感受，边听边扫比较容易跟住故事。X 的关键词加亮和按音乐时机出现的感受提示更有优势，音乐细节也更丰富，但感受层次堆叠较密，容易让视线被零碎信息牵走。综合来看，Y 更容易让普通观众在有限时间内理解这个人一路为什么从小心、欢喜走向依恋、担忧，最后接受不确定性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f779f596-e784-4454-9e8a-5b55ad978eb9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062007632775Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:21:22.523095+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "91ddd38a2e0807355f36b41640a6606859caa7184e932061a67dc20e316e6c47", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments